  "instructions": [
    "Wash the fish well in salt water",
    "Apply the lemon juice to the fish and set aside for approximately 1 hour",
    "Fry the onions till they are light golden in color",
    "Remove with a slotted spoon and crush",
    "In the same oil put the red chillies , onion seeds , turmeric powder , red chilly powder and garlic",
    "Stir and fry for a few minutes till the oil separates",
    "Add the tomatoes and again stir and cook till the oil separates",
    "Add the fish",
    "Coarsely grind together the aniseed , coriander seeds , fenugreek seeds and mustard seeds",
    "Add this to the fish along with the green chillies and cook over a low heat till the fish is done , about 10 minute min"
